    "title": "Seoul with Kids: Korea's Best Family Attractions, Ranked by Real Parents",
    "excerpt": "From futuristic digital art museums to ancient palaces with interactive programs — real parents rank Seoul's best family attractions by what kids actually love.",
    "date": "2026-05-05",
