    "title": "Why Smart Parents Use Specialized Travel Directories (Not Just Google)",
    "excerpt": "Google gives you 47 million results for 'family vacation Asia.' Most are useless. Here's why curated directories are the smarter choice for busy parents.",
    "date": "2026-04-25",
    "author": "Family Travel Team",
